{"v":4,"catch":"SUPER PACMAN 以雙能量球為動力","desc":"《SUPER PAC-MAN》是NAMCO於1982年發行的動作遊戲。\n這是 NAMCO 的旗艦遊戲“PAC-MAN”的額外強化！\n吃 SUPER 能量球 即可立於不敗之地並獲得速度提升！ 之後吃掉一個能量球並成為SUPER PAC-MAN，一次性消滅所有的“幽靈”！\n\n“Arcade Archives”系列忠實再現了許多經典的Arcade傑作。\n玩家可以改變各種遊戲設置，例如遊戲難度，並且還可以重現那時的街機顯示設置的氛圍。 玩家也可以通過高分來與世界各地的選手展開競爭。\n請享受為視頻遊戲打造一代的傑作。","publisher":"HAMSTER","release":"2022-01-06","genres":["動作","街機"],"players":"單機 1–2 人","langs":["日文","英文","西班牙文","法文","德文","意大利文"],"pmax":2,"poff":2,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 0.0GB / Switch 0.0GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/c00faccc67f610ea6750ef26c511b08616f1f0d4df4518b17200a1c4e6dac0e8.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/175fe71443a1ddec9ab16791bd16cb3e226064dc2f9902d33ee9ea3d740f84c1.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/a65b955cfa2b0c08795149847187b1db4a0e5b8feee0fe42c7940c07eb286710.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/7d89a82ecaf3155065de8f7d6500af6c3eef926229ca9fefc9c0dc567e9c7241.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/d8e7cb3edc3a04c29d42d30c1136980c13c091bb2b74181111feb8a25a07f7e8.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/a33d46faedc6bf0584ed8d0ffb9a1c32c93a51963fe4ea1025439aba8e11d0e3.jpg"],"titleId":"0100c52016a06000","dlc":[]}